      "content": "but that's the thing... you can't rewrite it. the damage is done. millions of people have seen the posts, they've seen the articles. they don't see a \"person with shortcomings,\" they see a monster. even if i tried to change, the version of me that exists in everyone else's head is ruined. i'm already a ghost in my own life. it feels like i'm just haunting a space that doesn't want me anymore.",
